  "summary": "Close the OD-006 constructor and refusal drift guards.",
  "why": "The original tests fixed the role and delta tables but accepted extra, missing, or reordered constructor inputs and did not close every approved refusal clause. Exact fence, paragraph, ordered-claim, and adversarial mutation guards now prevent that entire drift class without changing OD-006 semantics."
